@startuml
title Browser to model: session setup, safety gates, release and reset
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor User
box "Browser boundary" #F6EBDC
participant "React interface" as ui
end box
box "Application boundary: one FastAPI process" #E8F0FA
participant "HTTP/session boundary" as api
participant "LangGraph safety net" as graph
database "ContextStore" as memory
participant "LangChain + circuits" as adapter
end box
box "Model service" #FBE9E4
participant "Judge role" as judge
participant "Selected specialist\nmixing OR production" as model
end box
User -> ui : open local app
ui -> api : POST /api/session (same Origin)
api -> memory : create server-owned Principal + conversation\nor restore existing cookie session
api --> ui : HttpOnly cookie; CSRF token; accepted history
User -> ui : drinks question
ui -> api : POST /api/chat\ncookie + CSRF + JSON {message}\nX-Chat-Language: en or fa
api -> api : validate Host, Origin, session, CSRF, language\nbound body before parsing; reject extra fields
alt boundary rejection
  api --> ui : 401 / 403 / 413 / 415 / 422
else admitted HTTP request
  api -> graph : server Principal, conversation, message
  group Host admission and input rules
    graph -> memory : owner, TTL, rate, busy checks
    graph -> graph : global cap + deterministic input rules
  end
  alt admission or input rules reject
    graph --> api : static reply; no model call or memory commit
  else eligible for context and review
  group Safety net: context and input review
    graph -> memory : authorized bounded context
    graph -> adapter : inspect input
    adapter -> judge : fixed rubric + untrusted JSON
    judge --> adapter : InputEvidence + specialist topic
    adapter --> graph : schema-validated observations
    graph -> graph : reduce risks, drinks scope, name, uncertainty\nvalidate mixing / production route
  end
  alt input rejected or service unavailable
    graph --> api : static fallback; no generation/commit
  else input accepted
    graph -> adapter : invoke exactly one selected specialist
    adapter -> model : fixed drinks + specialist + selected language instructions\nuntrusted task data
    model --> adapter : candidate
    adapter --> graph : buffered draft
    group Safety net: output
      graph -> graph : deterministic output rules
      alt deterministic output rules reject
        graph --> api : static fallback; no output judge or commit
      else deterministic output rules pass
        graph -> adapter : inspect exact candidate
        adapter -> judge : output rubric + original context + draft
        judge --> adapter : OutputEvidence
        adapter --> graph : schema-validated observations
        graph -> graph : safety + in_scope + uncertainty + quality
        alt all output gates pass
          graph -> memory : reauthorize + commit accepted exchange
          graph --> api : inspected reply
        else output rejected or service unavailable
          graph --> api : static fallback; discard draft
        end
      end
    end
  end
  end
  api --> ui : buffered JSON reply/status\n200 for accepted/refused; 429 busy; 503 unavailable
  ui --> User : render plain text; retain failed request for retry
end
User -> ui : New conversation
ui -> api : POST /api/reset + cookie + CSRF
alt active turn
  api --> ui : 409 session_busy; preserve conversation
else idle conversation
  api -> memory : delete idle conversation; create new one\nretain server owner and rate history
  api --> ui : empty history + rotated CSRF
end
note over adapter,model
Three calls on a successful turn.
No retries or cloud fallback.
Separate judge and shared specialist generation circuits.
Auditor is evaluation-only with a separate circuit.
Failures and invalid evidence fail closed.
end note
note over api,memory
Cookie identifies an anonymous local browser, not a verified person.
Process-local state expires and disappears on server restart.
No public identity service or shared distributed quotas are deployed.
end note
footer Agentic Drink Book | Policy 2.1.0 | Model judgments remain fallible
@enduml
